      "content": "but what if there isn't anything left to save? what if the house is just too empty now? it feels more peaceful thinking about just... turning the lights off myself. like, if i just go into the dark on my own terms, i won't have to feel the terror of watching it happen slowly. it feels like the only way to keep some kind of control over it.",
